OL,3,GNEWSAYoung people warn of 'hopeless'
OL,4,Ajob-seeking process
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people in Surrey say job-seeking
OL,7,Fand looking for apprenticeships or
OL,8,Fother placements can feel like a
OL,9,F"hopeless process", as plans are to be
OL,10,Funveiled on how to better open up
OL,11,Fopportunities for them.
OL,13,FNearly one million young people aged
OL,14,F16-24 are classed as not in employment,
OL,15,Feducation or training (Neet) in the UK
OL,16,Faccording to official statistics.
OL,18,FPeople seeking work in Surrey Heath say
OL,19,Fthe competitive job market makes it
OL,20,F"really hard to find your footing",
OL,21,Fpiling pressure on them to find an
OL,22,Fopportunity.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
